WEBVTT

00:05:59.597 --> 00:06:01.697
of expressing their stories.

00:06:02.063 --> 00:06:03.730
They tell their truths.

00:06:03.763 --> 00:06:05.363
They reveal secrets.

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:07.630
They bare their souls.

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:11.963
They share stories of pain,
of feeling seen,

00:06:11.997 --> 00:06:13.963
of not being smart enough.

00:06:14.497 --> 00:06:16.530
Stories of being scared,

00:06:16.563 --> 00:06:19.263
feeling pretty or not.

00:06:20.563 --> 00:06:21.730
No matter where I teach,

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:25.997
I've come to realize
how many of their stories are universal.

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:29.697
They convey so many shared experiences:

00:06:29.697 --> 00:06:31.397
rejection,